1
00:00:10,577 --> 00:00:12,955
Manuel!

2
00:00:28,345 --> 00:00:30,213
Manuel!

3
00:00:44,347 --> 00:00:47,934
It's okay. We had to tie her down.

4
00:01:06,375 --> 00:01:10,503
I need a mirror. Now! At least 3 feet high.

5
00:01:10,962 --> 00:01:13,965
Move! Go, now!

6
00:01:20,792 --> 00:01:23,002
No!

7
00:01:28,257 --> 00:01:30,885
Show yourself.

8
00:01:35,055 --> 00:01:38,350
Smile pretty, you vain prick.

9
00:01:45,733 --> 00:01:48,235
For your boss.

10
00:01:48,652 --> 00:01:50,280
Pull it!

11
00:01:50,452 --> 00:01:55,331
Most cops go 20 years without firing their guns.

12
00:01:57,834 --> 00:02:01,337
Why do I always know where these guys are?

13
00:02:01,588 --> 00:02:04,549
Where to aim, when to fire.

14
00:02:06,759 --> 00:02:11,096
I'm wondering, is there something wrong with me, Father?

15
00:02:11,097 --> 00:02:13,098
Something damned?

16
00:02:13,099 --> 00:02:17,020
God has a plan for you. He has a plan for us all.

17
00:02:18,354 --> 00:02:22,983
You mustn't let your faith be overshadowed by guilt.

18
00:02:22,984 --> 00:02:25,737
Yeah, I'm trying.

19
00:02:25,862 --> 00:02:28,823
I'm trying real hard.

20
00:02:30,533 --> 00:02:31,285
Isabel.

21
00:02:55,866 --> 00:02:58,577
Isabel.

22
00:03:11,375 --> 00:03:15,211
And now I'm gonna be done in by this.

23
00:03:15,544 --> 00:03:18,631
Wouldn't be the first, John.

24
00:03:19,882 --> 00:03:22,217
Come on, Les.

25
00:03:22,218 --> 00:03:25,386
You saved me before, you can do it again, right?

26
00:03:25,388 --> 00:03:27,890
This is aggressive.

27
00:03:28,808 --> 00:03:32,602
Twenty years ago, you didn't wanna be here.

28
00:03:32,603 --> 00:03:36,982
Now you don't wanna leave. Yeah, that's a good idea.

29
00:03:40,486 --> 00:03:42,823
John, you really need to prepare.

30
00:03:42,875 --> 00:03:44,000
- She fell from the roof? - She jumped.

31
00:03:46,419 --> 00:03:48,545
No.

32
00:03:48,546 --> 00:03:52,508
I know it's hard to accept. She was sick.

33
00:04:01,392 --> 00:04:04,854
- Isabel wouldn't kill herself. - Angie.

34
00:04:05,646 --> 00:04:09,734
She wouldn't kill herself. Period!

35
