Okay, Bally, enjoy it.

227
00:19:16,917 --> 00:19:19,290
The blood of God.

228
00:19:20,332 --> 00:19:22,000
He found it.

229
00:19:22,001 --> 00:19:25,254
Whatever killed the son of God

230
00:19:25,880 --> 00:19:29,884
will give birth to the son of the devil.

231
00:19:31,833 --> 00:19:34,831
My work here is done.

232
00:19:36,624 --> 00:19:38,500
What are you laughing at?

233
00:19:38,501 --> 00:19:41,420
She was my only mission,

234
00:19:41,421 --> 00:19:44,757
and you brought her right to us.

235
00:19:45,917 --> 00:19:50,583
Jesus didn't die nailed to a cross. He was killed by a soldier's spear.

236
00:19:50,584 --> 00:19:52,835
The Spear of Destiny.

237
00:19:52,836 --> 00:19:55,880
I'm a Catholic, John. I know the Crucifixion story.

238
00:20:04,431 --> 00:20:07,851
I drew out the sister as you asked.

239
00:20:09,728 --> 00:20:13,398
She's been made flush and ready.

240
00:20:15,250 --> 00:20:19,999
Beeman said Mammon needed divine assistance to cross over.

241
00:20:21,167 --> 00:20:24,712
How's the blood of God's only son?

242
00:20:25,046 --> 00:20:27,674
The stains on the spear.

243
00:20:28,591 --> 00:20:31,593
- Yeah. - So he gets the spear.

244
00:20:31,594 --> 00:20:35,013
He still has to locate a powerful psychic.

245
