Not really.

246
00:20:39,602 --> 00:20:42,188
Twins.

247
00:20:42,897 --> 00:20:44,630
Where's the amulet?

248
00:20:51,835 --> 00:20:54,093
- Wait here. - Yeah.

249
00:20:54,125 --> 00:20:56,880
- The balance. - Screw the balance.

250
00:21:03,045 --> 00:21:05,756
